    "available": true,
    "excerpt": "Automatic skill curation for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). After every N real conversation turns (default 3), the plugin fires a background subagent that reads a digest of the session and edits, merges, prunes and creates SKILL.md files under the user skills directory (/.dsh/skills/) —"
